
### 1. Root endpoint — expect 200
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/?token=jessica

### 2. Get all users — expect 200
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/users/?token=jessica

### 3. Get current user — expect 200
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/users/me?token=jessica

### 4. Get user by username — expect 200
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/users/rick?token=jessica

### 5. Get all items — expect 200
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/?token=jessica
X-Token: fake-super-secret-token

### 6. Get item by ID — expect 200
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/plumbus?token=jessica
X-Token: fake-super-secret-token

### 7. Update item — expect 200
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/plumbus?token=jessica
X-Token: fake-super-secret-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "The great Plumbus"
}

### 8. Admin endpoint — expect 200
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/admin/?token=jessica
X-Token: fake-super-secret-token

### 9. Missing query token — expect 422
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/users/

### 10. Invalid query token — expect 400
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/?token=bob

### 11. Missing X-Token header — expect 422
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/?token=jessica

### 12. Invalid X-Token header — expect 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/admin/?token=jessica
X-Token: wrong-token
